title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/panel:toggle
catalog: GUI command
target: panel:toggle
summary: Toggle a layout flag (split / fullscreen)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``f11`` → ``panel:toggle fullscreen``
* ``v f`` → ``panel:toggle fullscreen``
* ``v v`` → ``panel:toggle split``
